Docker practice:
!!! Important Commands !!!
1: sudo usermod -aG docker $USER    jab b hum new ubuntu run kr k docker run krty hain to permissions nai hoti. docker ps nahi run hogi.hum docker group permi      me                    add krty hain is command se.
2: docker ps              yeh running container dikhay ga
3: docker ps -a           yeh tamam cont dikhay ga.crashed.exited wgera
4: docker images          yeh hamary pass jitne b images hain wo show kry ga
5: docker pull nginx/ubuntu/debien etc   yeh docker.hub se images pull kry ga
  !!!   Important   !!!
jab b container install kryn ge   agr to web ka container hai to ports ba host machine k sath map krna hain
5b: sudo ss -tulnp | grep 8080   to check a specific port ifd its occupied or not
6: docker run -p 80:80 nginx    yeh tab tak running me hogi jab tak hum exit nai hoty. exit hone k baad band ho jay ga
7: docker run -d  --name  ayaz-docker  -p 80:80 nginx    ab yeh exit hone k baad b running me rahy ga
8: docker rm -f <container name>
9: watch docker ps        is se yeh continous watch kry ga
10: docker stats          yeh command cpu wgera sab resources ki consuming show kry ga
11: docker exec -it   <name>  bash   container k andr jane ki command

___________________________________________________________________________


!!! Network !!!

Network Part:
docker network ls                yeh command hai docker me networks dekhne k liye, yaad rahy k containers apas me baat nahi kr sakty even k wo same network
sudo docker network create <docker-testing>   yeh hai network create krne k liye. our cont ko network ka part bnay ge.
docker network connect <network_name> <container_name>    running cont ko network se connect krne k liye command.



_____________________________________________________________________________

!!! Volume  !!!    

sudo docker volume ls       yeh volumes ko dekhne k liye.

container k sab details is folder me hain cd /var/lib/docker        yaha network,container,images ahr qism ki details hongi.
sudo docker volume create   <name>
sudo docker volume ls    volumes create krty hain phir isko use krne k liye attach b krna hota hai.
sudo docker run -d --name mysql -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=root -v my_data_volume:/var/lib/mysql -p 3306:3306 mysql      Hum multiple cont ek volume k sath attach kr sakty hain.


!!! Docker Bind Mount !!!

yeh kafi tricky hai. basically is me ek centralized folder ban jata hai host machine me. container me app ka folder hum isi folder k sath bind krty hain, jis k baad jo b file hum is folder me bnay ge wo shared hogi. jaisa k hum ne isko html k path diya hua, to web ki file yeh yahi se uthay ga. mene jo lab perform ki:
mkdir  storage
/storage   mkdir app_01_data
/storage   mkdir app_01_database_data
/storage   mkdir app_02_data
/storage   mkdir app_02_database_data     yeh 4 folders create kiye ab containers create kiye
sudo ss -tulnp | grep 8080   port ki occupation dekhne k liye

sudo docker run -d  --name  nginx01  -p 8081:8081   -v /home/ubuntu/storage/app_01_data:/usr/share/nginx/html  nginx
/home/ubuntu/storage/app_01_data   is folder me gya our files bnai, phir container me gya
sudo docker exec -it nginx01 bash
/usr/share/nginx/html      yaha gya.file create ki our yeh ab host machine me b create ho gai.

sudo docker run -d  --name  nginx02  -p 8082:8082   -v /home/ubuntu/storage/app_02_data:/usr/share/nginx/html  nginx
/home/ubuntu/storage/app_02_data   is folder me gya our files bnai, phir container me gya
sudo docker exec -it nginx02 bash
/usr/share/nginx/html      yaha gya.file create ki our yeh ab host machine me b create ho gai.


