!!! Dockerfile !!!   custom image building.
 
hum iski file create krty hain. basic configs k sath hai
mv Dockerfile  custom_image/
mkdir custom_image ---> cd custom_image        
sudo vim Dockerfile

# Use official ubuntu image
FROM ubuntu

# Remove default nginx website
RUN apt update
RUN apt install nginx -y

# Copy your static files to nginx folder


# Expose port 80 & 8080
EXPOSE 80
EXPOSE 8080

# Start nginx
CMD ["nginx", "-g", "daemon off;"]


abhi file prepare ki hai. build nahi
sudo docker images
###
###
sudo docker build -t my_nginx_app:v1 . 

agr file name dena hai to command aise hai.
sudo docker build -t my_nginx_app:v1 -f Dockerfile_nginx_image .

